        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9025/102, 4 Inch New Yorker Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOn the leading edge of trendy, the New Yorker 4 Inch Cabinet Pull offers one of the most popular shapes for modern kitchens. The Rectangular New Yorker 4 Inch Cabinet Pull is contemporary, sleek, and beautiful. Choose one of 6 modern finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is available in <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=omn-9025\"><b>Other Sizes</b></a>:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/new-yorker-6-inch-cabinet-pull-omnia-9025-153\"><b>6 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/new-yorker-8-inch-cabinet-pull-omnia-9025-203\"><b>8 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/new-yorker-10-inch-cabinet-pull-omnia-9025-254\"><b>10 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/new-yorker-12-inch-cabinet-pull-omnia-9025-305\"><b>12 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and \r\n<a href=\"/products/new-yorker-18-inch-cabinet-pull-omnia-9025-457\"><b>18 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9025 Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
